<div class="Section1" style="vsb_tmp: 19px -1px"> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">为服务国家外交工作，通过向国际组织输送人才更好地参与国际事务，培养和储备一批国际组织人才，国家留学基金管理委员会（简称国家留学基金委）设立并实施国际组织实习项目，选拔资助优秀学生赴联合国教科文组织总部及其地区办事处（驻华办事处除外）实习。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">为进一步推动我校与世界知名大学和机构的合作，充分发挥国家公派交流项目的优势，提高学生的创新意识、实践能力和国际竞争力，现就我校“</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年赴国际组织实习项目（联合国教科文组织实习人员）”选派工作通知如下：</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px"><strong><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">一、选派计划</span></strong></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（一）</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年全国计划选派</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">21</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">人赴教科文组织总部及地区办事处实习。国家留学基金委不直接受理个人申请，我校将根据报名情况择优推荐。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（二）选派对象为：</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、我校</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年优秀应届本科、硕士、博士毕业生；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、我校派出的赴国外高校或科研机构学习的国家公派或自费应届本科、硕士、博士毕业生；其中，</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年国际组织实习项目（赴联合国教科文组织实习人员）面向在外留学人员选拔的实施国别：美国、加拿大、古巴、日本、韩国、新加坡、泰国、以色列、南非、澳大利亚、新西兰、俄罗斯、白俄罗斯、乌克兰、捷克、德国、法国、瑞士、比利时、奥地利、荷兰、意大利、西班牙、葡萄牙、瑞典、丹麦、挪威、芬兰、英国、爱尔兰、匈牙利、塞尔维亚。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">3</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、申请时已获得联合国教科文组织录用函（通知）尚未开始实习的我校人员。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（三）实习期限一般为</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">6-12</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">个月，具体以联合国教科文组织录用通知为准。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（四）国家留学基金为留学人员提供一次往返国际旅费、资助期限内的奖学金（包括伙食费、住宿费、交通费、电话费、医疗保险费、交际费、一次性安置费、签证延长费、零用费等）和艰苦地区补贴。奖学金资助标准为</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1800</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">欧元（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2400</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">美元）</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">/</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">人</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">/</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月，艰苦地区补贴按照《国家公派留学人员艰苦地区补贴标准》提供。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 0cm;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">三、</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">申请条件</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(一)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">热爱社会主义祖国，具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">无违法违纪记录。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(二)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">具有坚定理想信念和为祖国服务的强烈事业心、责任感、献身精神。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(三)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">具有中华人民共和国国籍，不具有国外永久居留权。年龄满</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">18</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">周岁，不超过</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">32</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">周岁（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1983</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">以后出生）。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(四)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">身体健康、心理健康，诚实守信，意志坚定。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(五)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">具有较强的综合素质、国际视野和多元文化意识，熟悉国际合作规范。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(六)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">精通英语和（或）法语；同时掌握其他联合国官方语言者优先，具体详见附件岗位要求。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(七)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">具备优秀的计算机及社交媒体方面的知识，以及熟练运用办公软件的能力。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(八)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">能够适应国际工作环境，以及具备良好的人际沟通能力。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin-left: 0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">(九)</span><span style="font: 9px times new roman"> &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">符合实习岗位的其他要求。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">四、选拔及录取方式</span></p> 
 <p style="text-justify: inter-ideograph;text-align: justify;line-height: 37px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px 42px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（一）申请及评审</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、遵循“公开、公平、公正”的原则，采取“个人申请，单位推荐，专家评审，择优录取”的方式进行选拔。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、申请人根据教科文组织公布的</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年岗位需求，选择</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2-3</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">个意向岗位，并在个人陈述中予以说明。同等条件下，优先考虑录用赴艰苦地区和服从岗位调剂的申请人。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">3</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、申请人应提交的申请材料清单：</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）两封专家推荐信（英文）。推荐人应（曾）为申请人导师</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">/</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">主管负责人或同事，能够客观详实地对申请人进行评价和推荐；推荐信应为英文，使用推荐人所在单位专用信函纸（有单位抬头名称）打印并由推荐人本人签字。推荐信将提交至联合国教科文组织；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）外语水平证明</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">.</span></span><span lang="EN-US"></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">如申请人掌握多门外语，须将相应的外语水平证明上传； </span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">3</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）专业水平（资格）证明：包括计算机水平、相关专业认证等。专业资格证书包括律师证、记者证、会计师证等</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">;</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">4</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）成绩单复印件（本科及以上，英文）。需提交英文成绩单，在读学生应提交本科开始至最近一学期的成绩单；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">5</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）最高学历</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">/</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">学位证书复印件；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">6</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）有效身份证明复印件。国内申请人上传身份证复印件，在外学习人员须上传身份证及护照复印件；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">7</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）个人陈述（英文）。包括意向国别和岗位以及选择原因（应选择</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2-3</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">个意向岗位），是否服从调剂，申请动机，对于申请单位及岗位的基本认识，现从事专业与实习岗位及国际组织工作的相关性，个人职业理想等，字数不限。个人陈述将提交至联合国教科文组织；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">8</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）个人简历（英文）。在留学基金委网站下载个人简历模板（见《</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年国际组织实习项目网上报名指南》），用英文填写并签字后扫描上传，作为个人资料提交至联合国教科文组织</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">;</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">9</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）国家留学基金管理委员会出国留学申请表</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">(</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">访问学者类</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">)</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">10</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">）单位推荐意见表；</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">申请人需在</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">2016</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">15</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日— </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">20</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日间</span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">准备相关报名材料，并将原件提交至国际合作与交流处。所有材料应确保齐全、真实有效。同时，登录留学基金委网上报名系统</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312"><span style="font-family: times new roman">（</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">http://apply.csc.edu.cn)</span></span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">进行网上报名，“申请类别”请选择——访学类。在外留学人员直接进行网上报名。</span></p> 
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">4</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、国际合作与交流处将会同教务处、研究生院、学生工作处等相关部门，组织专家对申请材料进行评审，并按照“公开、公平、公正”的原则进行选拔，经校内评审和公示后向国家留学基金委推荐。</span></p> 
 <p style="text-justify: inter-ideograph;text-align: justify;line-height: 37px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px 42px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（二）校内选拔时间安排</span></p> 
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">申请时间：</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">11</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日—</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman"> 2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">20</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日</span></span></p> 
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">评审时间：</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">21</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日</span></span></p> 
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">公示时间：</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">22</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日—</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman"> 2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">24</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日</span></span></p> 
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">学校在</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">29</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">日前将书面公函及推荐人选名单提交至国家留学基金委，并同时通过信息平台提交申请人的电子材料。申请人的书面材料由受理单位留存，留存期限为</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="text-justify: inter-ideograph;text-align: justify;line-height: 37px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px 42px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（三）笔试面试安排</span></p> 
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、国家留学基金委于</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2-3</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月对申请人进行资格审核、笔试及专家面试，确定候选人并向联合国教科文组织推荐。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">、教科文组织于</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">4-5</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月对候选人进一步进行考核（电话面试</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">/</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">视频面试等）后，根据自身岗位要求确定最终录取人员。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">五、派出与管理</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（一）国家留学基金委于</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">6</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月通过国家公派留学管理信息平台公布录取结果。录取通知及录取材料由学校转发申请人。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（二）国家留学基金委将对录取人员开展行前培训。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（三）</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">6</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">月底，被录取人员根据联合国教科文组织确定的时间办理签证、预订机票等派出手续。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">（四）申请人应充分考虑未来就业、学业等因素，慎重申报，避免录取后放弃资格的情况。</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">六、咨询方式</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">咨询电话：</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">029-88202221</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">国际合作与交流处孔老师</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">咨询、报名邮箱：</span><span lang="EN-US"><a href="mailto:liuxue@xidian.edu.cn" style="font-family: times new roman;text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">liuxue@xidian.edu.cn</span></a></span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">纸质材料接收地址：西安电子科技大学北校区</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">5</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">号楼</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">110</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">办公室，邮编</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">710071</span></span></p> 
 <p style="text-justify: inter-ideograph;text-align: justify;line-height: 37px;text-indent: 40px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px 0px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">注：本通知中的日期和时间均为北京时间。其他未尽事宜以《</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">2016</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">年国际组织实习项目（联合国教科文组织实习人员）选派办法》为准。</span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">附件：</span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: -79px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px 119px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span id="1l72l781bf"><img border="0" src="/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif" /><a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1070628979&wbfileid=A1F4FB78F3B463B7B43098211F8D02B1" style="font-family: times new roman;text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">附件1：联合国教科文组织2016年实习岗位.zip</span></a></span></span></p> 
 <p style="line-height: 37px;text-indent: -79px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px 119px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;font-size: 21px"><span id="3r3krn21bf"><img border="0" src="/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1070628979&wbfileid=F191C5D6FEC3AEE50F4C1AEC430F4528" style="font-family: times new roman;text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-family: times new roman;font-size: 21px">附件2：2016年国际组织实习项目网上报名指南（赴联合国教科文组织实习人员）.docx</span></a></span></span></p> 
 <p style="text-justify: inter-ideograph;text-align: justify;line-height: 37px;text-indent: -74px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px 114px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px"><span id="5g1313w1bf"><img border="0" src="/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif" /><a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1070628979&wbfileid=171126A5C310FB72C5D8FA1F10C3AB6A" style="font-family: times new roman;text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-family: times new roman;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px">附件3：英文个人简历模板.zip</span></a></span></span></p> 
 <p style="text-align: right;line-height: 37px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px">国际交流与合作处</span></p> 
 <p style="text-align: right;line-height: 37px;margin: 0cm 0cm 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px">2016</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family: times new roman;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px">年</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">1</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px">月</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: times new roman">11</span><span style="font-family: times new roman;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 21px">日</span></span></p>
</div>
